{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatars</strong> is an AI-powered creative sandbox and social role-play experience where you design unique characters and bring them to life. Choose a name, photo, backstory, and personality tone to shape your creation, then release it into the community for others to discover and interact with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each avatar uses artificial intelligence to generate dynamic conversations and unique behaviors based on the traits you define, making every interaction feel personal and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/extras/16ebf7b9db5ce4eb69822816048346dc.avif?t=1764247151\" width=780 height=200 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/extras/6fa4498cd0e4bbcf75cba4cede3265c5.avif?t=1764247151\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/extras/5af4122974c63219ed591887020aabf8.avif?t=1764247151\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/extras/4702d6efe3915e471c1fce9f5e149e6a.avif?t=1764247151\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/extras/f13d88a1a9aa3ed09c21795eeebb9f4c.avif?t=1764247151\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/extras/8eef5beac0fd1f3050f31b7291bc6ddf.avif?t=1764247151\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/extras/f1d40b26839449cb4a430048b4d36cab.avif?t=1764247151\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a wide set of features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Driven Personalities:</strong> Every avatar has its own conversational style and logic powered by artificial intelligence, adapting to its mood, tone, and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatar Creation:</strong> Build characters in minutes by combining names, images, biographies, and personality traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Role-Play &amp; Interaction:</strong> Talk naturally with your avatars or those created by other players\u2014each responds in real time according to its defined personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Sharing:</strong> Publish your creations and explore a growing library of AI-generated characters made by others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voting &amp; Discovery:</strong> Rate community avatars, climb the charts, and find unique personalities shared by fellow players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Variety:</strong> Create celebrities, historical figures, fictional heroes, or completely original personas\u2014your imagination sets the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Sessions or Long Play:</strong> Jump in for a short AI chat or spend hours expanding your collection and developing complex personalities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatars</strong> is not about winning or losing, but about <strong>creativity, imagination, and AI-powered social play</strong>. Build your personal collection, interact with living characters, and share the avatars that only you could imagine.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just Chatting!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4072280/b0055e927e2340520a855628f334e06d5c19f4dc.jpg"},{"name":"Artist!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4072280/dead6a3504614eaa0bb471ae90da74fa1632e784.jpg"},{"name":"Publisher!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4072280/b58b4b37d9365cc3df24064eac055bf55442afba.jpg"},{"name":"Rater!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4072280/881b614c58913ca79cc7f9d53a66684de9772aeb.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072280?t=1764247151","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072280?t=1764247151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/850c9312458cdbc5e1e0876357bb299bd2f3e4c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764247151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/850c9312458cdbc5e1e0876357bb299bd2f3e4c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764247151","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072280/extras/59dca13fea3d3952365022baf81a62b6.avif?t=1764247151\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatars</strong> is an AI-powered creative sandbox and social role-play experience where you design unique characters and bring them to life